  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Next generation peste-des-petits ruminats (PPR) vaccines that differentiate between infected and vaccinated animals (DIVA) - proof of concept in sheep</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peste des petits ruminants (PPR) is a highly contagious disease, severely affecting small ruminants in almost 70 countries. This project will facilitate licencing and commercialisation of vaccines and tests to support effective control of PPR in Africa, the Middle East and parts of Asia.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research and development activity contributing to the UK&#x2019;s strategy to address key development challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
